Changes made by Elestio in this fork (all baked into source, no runtime patching):

  - public/styles.css ......... Elestio brand theme + customer lock-down appended at the
                                end of the file. NOTE: a separate CSS file is NOT possible —
                                bin/pi-webui.mjs (normalizeStaticPath) serves a hardcoded
                                static whitelist, so any non-whitelisted file 404s. The CSS
                                must live inside styles.css.
  - public/index.html ......... composer placeholder "Ask Pi…" -> "Ask Elestio AI DevOps…";
                                theme-color meta -> #091020.
  - public/app.js ............. busyPromptBehavior default "followUp" -> "steer"; PWA service
                                worker registration disabled (never registers on a fresh
                                browser, so the UI is correct on first paint — no theme flash).
  - public/service-worker.js .. replaced with a self-unregistering stub that purges caches,
                                to kill any SW already installed on returning clients.
  - package.json .............. renamed to @elestio/pi-webui; removed all optionalDependencies
                                (incl. @firstpick/pi-extension-safety-guard "Dangerous bash
                                command" modal) and pruned pi.* resource arrays to ./index.ts
                                only; pinned @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent to 0.80.2.

